    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stylish 5 Bed/2 En-suite/2 Bath Country Home with Matching Garage on 0.6 Acres. Close to all Amenities and Beaches!\r\n\r\n‘Church View’ is a beautifully presented 5 bedroom country residence with 2 en-suites and 2 bathrooms, extending to c. 158m2 and set on c. 0.6 acres of mature, landscaped grounds. Recently renovated and refurbished to a high standard, the home blends traditional country character with bright, contemporary living spaces, creating a warm and stylish setting for modern family life. The flowing open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas are designed for easy everyday use and relaxed entertaining, while the bi-fold doors, countryside outlooks and mature gardens enhance the sense of light, privacy and connection to the outdoors. A detached matching garage adds valuable flexibility for storage, hobbies or further lifestyle use. The location is equally appealing: peaceful and rural, yet within walking distance of Rathangan and Duncormick and ideally placed to enjoy the wider south Wexford coastline. Cullenstown Strand is just minutes away, while the popular seaside village of Kilmore Quay offers harbour walks, beaches, seafood, cafés, restaurants and access to the Saltee Islands. Further coastal amenities, sandy beaches and scenic villages are within easy reach, with the area providing a full range of shopping, schools, services and leisure facilities, and Rosslare Europort offering excellent connectivity for travel further afield.\r\n\r\nA turn-key countryside gem with village, coast and town all within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (3.27m x 1.20m)   PVC entry door with glass and sidelights, laminate floor, recessed lighting.\r\nInner Hallway (4.32m x 0.97m)  laminate floor, hot press/airing cupboard.\r\nLiving Room (5.83m x 3.44m)   laminate floor, raised brick-feature fireplace with oak mantle and solid fuel stove, staircase with storage, recess area with large window.\r\nKitchen / Dining / Family Room (7.66m x 6.33m)   a lovely open-plan space with tiled floor, a newly fitted quartz island, quartz countertops and splash back, integrated Siemens induction hob with downdraft extractor. The room also features floor-to-ceiling, custom-designed contemporary cabinetry, a washed-oak pantry, pellet stove, bi-fold doors opening to a lovely patio area and garden.\r\nUtility Room (3.28m x 1.98m)   tile floor, laminate countertops with tile splash back/walls, double window, PVC door with window opening.\r\nBathroom (2.12m x 2.52m)  fully tiled, WC, WHB, bathtub with overhead shower.\r\nBedroom 1 (Down) (2.97m x 2.54m)   currently used as an office/study, laminate floor.\r\nStairs / Landing (6.23m x 1.10m)   carpeted, recessed lighting, hot press/airing cupboard.\r\nBedroom 2 (4.67m x 3.03m)   carpet floor, vaulted ceiling, garden views.\r\nBathroom (2.47m x 2.34m)   fully tiled, WC, WHB, bathtub, skylight.\r\nBedroom 3 (3.26m x 2.98m)   carpet floor, garden & countryside views, en-suite.\r\nEn-suite (3.27m x 0.97m)   tiled floor with tile & painted walls, skylight, shower, WC, WHB.\r\nBedroom 4 (2.77m x 2.68m)   carpet floor, garden & countryside views, built-in wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 5 (4.80m x 2.40m)   carpet floor, garden & countryside views, en-suite.\r\nEn-suite (4.80m x 0.88m)   tiled floor with tile & painted walls, window, shower, WC, WHB."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "5 bed /2 en-suite plus 2 bathroom home, extending to c. 158m2 in turn-key condition and decorated to a high standard.\r\n0.6 acres of landscaped grounds with mature lawns, trees and excellent outdoor appeal.\r\nMatching detached garage of c. 63 sq m with roll-up door, side door and window, ideal for storage, workshop or lifestyle use.\r\nPlaster and painted exterior with slate roof.\r\nPVC doors, PVC double-glazed windows, white fascia and soffits.\r\nKerbed, gravel & concrete driveway, piers and gated entryways with ample parking.\r\nPeaceful countryside setting close to the popular villages of Rathangan and Duncormick.\r\nSuperb location: c. 20 minutes to Wexford town, c. 30 minutes to Rosslare Europort, c. 10 minutes to Kilmore Quay and c. 5 minutes to beautiful Cullenstown Strand.\r\nClose to all amenities, schools, shopping, popular restaurants, bars etc.\r\nMains water, Bioseptic system, E.S.B., O.F.C.H., solid fuel stove, pellet stove, fibre broadband."
      },
